1
00:00:11,640 --> 00:00:12,400
Elliot

2
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:14,280
Are you thinking of leaving?

3
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:21,280
I know.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,720
Our restaurant has been struggling to take off.

5
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:25,440
It's understandable if you want to change jobs.

6
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:32,360
If you want to leave, just go ahead.

7
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:34,560
Honestly, I'm fine managing on my own.

8
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,199
I'll remember what you said.

9
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:40,400
And I'll stick to my culinary philosophy.

10
00:00:41,240 --> 00:00:42,000
I believe in you.

11
00:00:42,280 --> 00:00:43,520
You’ll absolutely achieve success.

12
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:44,800
Of course.

13
00:00:45,240 --> 00:00:45,760
Oh, by the way…

14
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:47,720
Even if you're not with me in the future,

15
00:00:47,840 --> 00:00:49,240
You'll always be my good partner.

16
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:51,840
And I'll always have your back.

17
00:00:58,800 --> 00:00:59,640
Are you crying?

18
00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:02,520
No, I'm not.

19
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:06,760
Alright then.

20
00:01:06,880 --> 00:01:08,080
Let's not get too sentimental.

21
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:10,760
When do you plan to leave?

22
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:15,120
I've decided…

23
00:01:16,440 --> 00:01:17,080
I'm not leaving.

24
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:20,880
I want to stay and witness with you

25
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:22,760
the day our restaurant becomes a success.

26
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:30,520
Simple Restaurant is launching new dishes at half price!

27
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:32,720
Simple Restaurant is offering half-price specials!

28
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:33,880
Take a look!

29
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:35,600
Check out the half-price menu at Simple Restaurant!

30
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:36,520
Give it a try!

31
00:01:37,280 --> 00:01:39,760
Simple Restaurant’s half-price specials are here!

32
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:40,440
Hey, bro!

33
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:42,000
Simple Restaurant is offering half-price dishes!

34
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:42,960
Come take a look inside!

35
00:01:43,440 --> 00:01:44,480
Simple and delicious!

36
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,320
Lots of great deals!

37
00:01:45,440 --> 00:01:46,520
Come in and enjoy the taste!

38
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,720
Simple...

39
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,240
Hao Ruichi!

40
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,000
Stop right there!

41
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,600
Elliot, stop right now!

42
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,320
Stop right there!

43
00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:05,880
Stop! Do you think I’m stupid?!

44
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:07,680
Even if I run to my last breath, you won’t catch me!

45
00:02:12,880 --> 00:02:13,520
Stop!

46
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:18,400
Please, just let me go!

47
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:20,680
Why can't you let me live as an ordinary person on Earth Star?

48
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,680
Is that too much to ask?

49
00:02:22,760 --> 00:02:23,800
I didn't come here to capture you.

50
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,400
I want to ask you something.

51
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,160
You’re looking for me?

52
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:41,720
What exactly do you want?

53
00:02:44,720 --> 00:02:46,080
I need your help with something.

54
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,600
Did I hear you right?

55
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:50,520
The great Star Envoy,

56
00:02:50,800 --> 00:02:52,280
actually needs my help?

57
00:02:53,720 --> 00:02:54,360
Aiyet.

58
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:57,080
Please, go ahead. My apologies.

59
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:01,880
That day in the alley,

60
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:03,440
you said,

61
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,840
you found the most important thing,

62
00:03:07,160 --> 00:03:08,760
but couldn't understand your own heart.

63
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,040
What did you mean by that?

64
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:12,800
That's it?

65
00:03:13,720 --> 00:03:14,200
Yeah.

66
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,840
It's surprising that the great Star Envoy

67
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,160
could have this side of them.

68
00:03:20,320 --> 00:03:21,680
Stop beating around the bush.

69
00:03:22,320 --> 00:03:22,960
Just say it already.

70
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,040
Hao Ruichi,

71
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:26,720
don't you feel that on Blue Ke Star,

72
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,960
we’re far too indifferent?

73
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:30,400
All these rules, all these constraints,

74
00:03:30,920 --> 00:03:33,080
the more capable someone is, the colder they become.

75
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:34,920
In the end, we only talk about efficiency,

76
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:36,400
and just do what's supposedly the most correct.

77
00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:39,200
What kind of meaning does that life have?

78
00:03:42,600 --> 00:03:44,000
Answer my question.

79
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:46,680
I can see it now.

80
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:48,160
Your energy field is a mess.

81
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:50,040
Your inner self is full of hesitation.

82
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:53,960
That's true.

83
00:03:54,720 --> 00:03:55,560
I unintentionally formed a connection

84
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:57,640
with someone.

85
00:03:57,720 --> 00:03:58,760
See? Exactly.

86
00:03:58,880 --> 00:04:00,440
You don’t understand your own heart at all.

87
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,200
What do you mean?

88
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:06,280
Forming a connection isn’t the point.

89
00:04:06,360 --> 00:04:07,240
The important thing is,

90
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:10,160
she made you feel the power of love.

91
00:04:15,240 --> 00:04:16,000
Love?

92
00:04:16,080 --> 00:04:17,200
Love is the most magical force in the universe.

93
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:17,840
Love.

94
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,440
It's also the most powerful energy.

95
00:04:19,840 --> 00:04:21,560
It can influence everyone's mind.

96
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:23,400
On our emotionally cold Lanke Star,

97
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:25,400
we can't understand what it's like to fall for someone.

98
00:04:25,559 --> 00:04:26,640
What's that feeling like?

99
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:29,560
Are you saying that

100
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:32,040
the feeling in my heart is affection,

101
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:34,320
and not because of the link?

102
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:35,280
Of course.

103
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:37,400
The link is merely a formality.

104
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:38,560
Without emotions,

105
00:04:38,880 --> 00:04:40,280
no link is valid.

106
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:46,720
Hao Ruichi,

107
00:04:46,880 --> 00:04:48,440
are you really not arresting me?

108
00:04:54,800 --> 00:04:55,360
Qi Miao,

109
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,200
where are you going?

110
00:05:02,080 --> 00:05:02,880
I'm going on a business trip.

111
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:04,400
When will you be back?

112
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:06,600
Hao Ruichi,

113
00:05:07,280 --> 00:05:09,320
stop pretending to care about me.

114
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:11,000
I am a living person,

115
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:13,440
not just a tool for you to recharge.

116
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:14,640
I was wrong before.

117
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:15,520
I apologize to you.

118
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:17,880
In the future, if you haven't thought things through, don't say anything.

119
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,640
Once I return from my trip,

120
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:27,280
I'll move out.

121
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:30,200
Let's not see each other again.

122
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:41,240
Hao Ruichi,

123
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,800
what do I even mean to you?

124
00:05:55,400 --> 00:05:56,360
What are you thinking about?

125
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,480
Nothing.

126
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:01,640
I just didn't sleep well last night.

127
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:04,000
Director Chen has a reputation for being strict.

128
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,480
Be smart about what you do.

129
00:06:06,960 --> 00:06:07,600
Don't worry.

130
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,360
I won't mess up.

131
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:09,960
Deliver the script to the set.

132
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,080
Director Chen is rushing us.

133
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:20,160
Take the freight elevator on the right.

134
00:06:20,440 --> 00:06:21,240
Hurry up.

135
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:22,320
Alright.

136
00:06:51,440 --> 00:06:52,240
What's going on?

137
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:53,440
The elevator's malfunctioning.

138
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:55,880
Hello?

139
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:57,440
Is anyone there?

140
00:06:58,520 --> 00:06:59,120
Is anyone there?

141
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,320
The elevator is malfunctioning.

142
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:01,440
Is anyone there?

143
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:09,120
I forgot to bring my phone too.

144
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:14,040
Is anyone there?

145
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:15,400
Is anyone there?

146
00:07:16,560 --> 00:07:17,560
The elevator is malfunctioning.

147
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:19,040
Can anyone hear me?

148
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,680
Hao Ruichi!

149
00:07:40,320 --> 00:07:42,320
Stop pretending like you care about me.

150
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:44,000
I'm a living, breathing person.

151
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:46,480
Not just a tool for you to recharge your energy.

152
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,320
At that moment...

153
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:49,400
my heart...

154
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:50,840
why did it hurt so much?

155
00:08:06,760 --> 00:08:07,680
Teacher Jiang Shan.

156
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:09,240
Teacher Jiang Shan, is that you?

157
00:08:09,560 --> 00:08:10,520
Teacher Jiang Shan.

158
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:11,720
Can you hear me?

159
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:12,800
Teacher Jiang Shan.

160
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:14,080
The elevator is malfunctioning.

161
00:08:14,520 --> 00:08:15,600
Is that Teacher Jiang Shan?

162
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:16,880
Is there someone outside?

163
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:18,480
Hello? Hello?

164
00:08:18,600 --> 00:08:19,800
The elevator is malfunctioning.

165
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,560
Hello? Can you hear me? Hello?

166
00:08:32,280 --> 00:08:33,120
Qi Miao.

167
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:36,200
Why are you so unlucky?

168
00:08:40,839 --> 00:08:42,160
From now on,

169
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:45,320
I'm your lucky star.

170
00:08:46,480 --> 00:08:47,959
Liking someone pales in comparison

171
00:08:49,040 --> 00:08:49,839
when it comes to facing a connection.

172
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:54,160
Even when you appeared in my life,

173
00:08:55,360 --> 00:08:57,400
nothing in my life changed at all.

174
00:08:59,280 --> 00:09:00,920
There's no such thing as a lucky star.

175
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,400
Help!

176
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:14,160
Is anyone there?

177
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:15,920
Help! Somebody help!

178
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:18,280
Hao Ruichi.

179
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:34,760
Don't be scared.

180
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,080
I'm here.
